{"title":"我看自动驾驶技术","comparisons":{"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20160403.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20160220.html","to":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20160403.html","from_date":"2016-02-20","to_date":"2016-04-03","counts":{"added":3,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"如果你还没明白，也许下面这个图片可以把你拉回到现实世界：","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>如果你还没明白，也许下面这个图片可以把你拉回到现实世界：</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p><img src=\"http://upload-images.jianshu.io/upload_images/68562-39e22022670591ee.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/strip%7CimageView2/2/w/400\" alt=\"\" /></p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>一个机器，如何能知道旁边的车上正在发生什么，即将可能发生什么样的危险情况呢？它如何知道，需要赶快避开这辆车呢？它不能。一个没有认知能力的机器，是难以应付复杂多变的现实世界的。</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20161008.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20160403.html","to":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20161008.html","from_date":"2016-04-03","to_date":"2016-10-08","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20171205.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20161008.html","to":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20171205.html","from_date":"2016-10-08","to_date":"2017-12-05","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20171216.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20171205.html","to":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20171216.html","from_date":"2017-12-05","to_date":"2017-12-16","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"},"blog-cn_2016_02_12_self-driving-car_20200217.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2016_02_12_